      "content": "i try to take it one breath at a time but it feels so exhausting. like i'm just dragging myself through a world that doesn't have him in it anymore. it's like i'm a ghost in my own house. sometimes i just sit here and think... if he's out there somewhere, why am i still stuck here in this grayness?",
